            "**VA** loans are **guaranteed** for eligible veterans and some service members. They often require **no down payment**, no monthly PMI, and a **funding fee** (which can be financed). The veteran must **occupy** the home. A **CRV** (certificate of reasonable value) is the VA appraisal product.",
            "**USDA / Rural Housing** programs serve eligible rural buyers, often with little or no down payment. Eligibility is geographic and income-based.",
            "Know the shapes: **straight (term)** interest-only with a balloon of principal; **partially amortized** with a **balloon**; **graduated payment**; **buydown**; **blanket** (several parcels); **package** (realty plus personal property); **open-end**; **construction** (draws, then a **takeout**); **bridge/swing**; **purchase-money** (seller financing); **wraparound**; **HELOC**; **sale-leaseback**.",
